WEBVTT

00:00:17.740 --> 00:00:23.430
Another night, another ship filled 
with the despicable and greedy.

00:00:23.960 --> 00:00:26.840
Indeed, Dekoponpo-sama.

00:00:27.430 --> 00:00:29.440
How are things proceeding?

00:00:29.440 --> 00:00:34.440
The idle rich are arriving from not only Yamato,

00:00:34.440 --> 00:00:37.670
but the surrounding countries as well.

00:00:39.630 --> 00:00:42.270
It appears they are all keen to see it.

00:00:42.270 --> 00:00:44.080
But are you sure about this?

00:00:44.080 --> 00:00:45.960
To bring <i>those</i> into the capital—

00:00:47.090 --> 00:00:49.370
It is but the duty of a noble

00:00:49.370 --> 00:00:54.970
to bring dreams to those who dwell in this tainted world.

00:00:55.410 --> 00:00:57.390
Magnificent, Dekoponpo-sama.

00:00:57.390 --> 00:00:58.970
Your kindness truly knows no bounds.

00:00:58.970 --> 00:01:02.080
Have a <i>delightful</i> evening, my guests.

00:02:47.630 --> 00:02:50.790
I can't really see their faces.

00:02:50.790 --> 00:02:53.640
Stay focused, all right?{orig: Don't get too carried away.}

00:02:54.760 --> 00:02:56.800
Ukon personally asked us to do this.

00:02:57.160 --> 00:02:58.680
Now, now.

00:02:58.680 --> 00:03:01.410
A chance at somethin' like this doesn't exactly come our way every day.

00:03:01.410 --> 00:03:03.800
Be a shame not to enjoy it a little, y'know?

00:03:03.800 --> 00:03:06.490
Bringing Kuon along would just be a massive headache,

00:03:06.490 --> 00:03:08.550
so I brought you along instead.

00:03:08.550 --> 00:03:10.310
That might've been a mistake.

00:03:11.230 --> 00:03:13.200
<i>I've seen some of these faces at court.</i>

00:03:14.190 --> 00:03:16.780
<i>This is quite the expansive operation he's got here.</i>

00:03:18.180 --> 00:03:19.390
What's this sake?

00:03:19.390 --> 00:03:20.190
It's good!

00:03:20.690 --> 00:03:23.700
Shame the men here are all second-rate...{orig: All of these guys are just consolation prizes.}

00:03:23.700 --> 00:03:24.450
Hey!

00:03:28.080 --> 00:03:29.730
Stop sticking out like a sore thumb!

00:03:30.600 --> 00:03:31.460
Right.

00:03:31.830 --> 00:03:35.930
I'm gonna take a nice little stroll 'round the place.

00:03:35.930 --> 00:03:37.460
Hey, wait!

00:03:37.460 --> 00:03:39.460
See you boys later.

00:03:39.460 --> 00:03:41.760
You haven't forgotten our mission, right?

00:03:41.760 --> 00:03:42.420
Right.

00:03:42.420 --> 00:03:44.380
D-D-D-D-D...

00:03:44.380 --> 00:03:45.790
Dekoponpo!

00:03:45.790 --> 00:03:47.160
Yeah, that!

00:03:47.160 --> 00:03:49.220
We're here to expose his corruption, right?

00:03:49.670 --> 00:03:52.430
Still, I'm surprised you came yourself.

00:03:52.430 --> 00:03:54.150
Is this going to be that hard?

00:03:55.160 --> 00:03:56.380
In a sense, yeah.

00:03:56.900 --> 00:03:58.380
Silence, everyone!

00:03:59.760 --> 00:04:05.760
My lord, {and }the host of this banquet,

00:04:05.760 --> 00:04:08.240
will now give a few words.

00:04:09.010 --> 00:04:10.220
If you please.

00:04:12.680 --> 00:04:15.850
My warmest welcome to everyone here.

00:04:15.850 --> 00:04:18.600
I have prepared only the finest sake,

00:04:18.600 --> 00:04:21.950
the most exquisite delicacies, 
and highest quality entertainment for you all.

00:04:21.950 --> 00:04:26.260
Forget the hardships of the mortal world and enjoy yourselves to the fullest!

00:04:29.260 --> 00:04:31.770
Hey, Ukon, isn't that...

00:04:31.770 --> 00:04:33.040
Yep.

00:04:33.040 --> 00:04:35.770
One of the Eight Pillar Generals, Dekoponpo.

00:04:46.890 --> 00:04:50.420
I've tried to uncover evidence 
of his corruption many times,

00:04:50.420 --> 00:04:52.120
{but it slips from my grasp every time.}but it always slips from my grasp.{alt: but it remains elusive to this day.}

00:04:52.120 --> 00:04:53.660
Him? Really?

00:04:54.260 --> 00:04:56.860
His family's served the 
Emperor for generations.

00:04:56.860 --> 00:04:58.990
He holds a lot of influence in the court,

00:04:59.750 --> 00:05:02.920
unlike a newcomer such as myself.

00:05:03.530 --> 00:05:05.670
That's kinda sad.

00:05:06.430 --> 00:05:08.680
I don't like it, but he's still one of the Eight.

00:05:11.160 --> 00:05:13.560
My apologies for the wait!

00:05:13.560 --> 00:05:20.560
Without further ado, 
let the underground gambling begin!

00:05:28.700 --> 00:05:30.200
Hey, now...

00:05:39.210 --> 00:05:41.210
I'll put ten thousand on Black!

00:05:41.210 --> 00:05:43.960
Red! Ten thousand on Red!

00:05:43.960 --> 00:05:46.180
Thirty thousand on Red!

00:05:44.520 --> 00:05:46.180
Is that...?

00:05:46.180 --> 00:05:48.020
Insect fighting.

00:05:48.020 --> 00:05:51.720
Two aggressive insects fight to the death, and onlookers gamble on the outcome.

00:05:51.720 --> 00:05:53.720
Five hundred on Red!

00:05:54.260 --> 00:05:56.060
Which one's lookin' more riled up?{orig: Which one has more energy?}

00:05:57.540 --> 00:05:59.730
My money's on Black, then.

00:06:00.280 --> 00:06:02.400
It's tilting towards Red...

00:06:05.320 --> 00:06:07.990
Atui, lend me some money—

00:06:07.990 --> 00:06:09.950
Go Black!

00:06:09.950 --> 00:06:11.780
She's not even listening.

00:06:11.780 --> 00:06:14.620
Hey, how much you got on you?

00:06:15.080 --> 00:06:16.380
Hustle, kid.

00:06:17.390 --> 00:06:18.560
Hey!

00:06:28.210 --> 00:06:31.380
Hey, you're acting weird today.

00:06:37.780 --> 00:06:38.920
Down there, huh?

00:06:38.920 --> 00:06:40.430
What is?

00:06:43.580 --> 00:06:45.790
Hey, this place is off limits—

00:06:55.660 --> 00:06:57.660
Wh-What are you doing?

00:07:12.330 --> 00:07:13.800
Whoa, that's...

00:07:16.570 --> 00:07:18.560
What's going on here?

00:07:21.480 --> 00:07:23.480
Stop ignoring...

00:07:23.780 --> 00:07:24.600
me!

00:07:26.550 --> 00:07:27.820
What are you doing!?

00:07:27.820 --> 00:07:29.690
I should be the one saying that.

00:07:30.570 --> 00:07:32.540
What's all the rush about?

00:07:32.540 --> 00:07:33.570
This isn't like you.

00:07:36.750 --> 00:07:38.830
Maybe you're right.

00:07:47.260 --> 00:07:48.660
Is something wrong?

00:07:49.460 --> 00:07:52.840
A long time ago, a single bug 
found its way into the capital

00:07:53.460 --> 00:07:55.830
and made a nest underground.

00:07:57.850 --> 00:08:01.850
It would breed by laying its eggs in the bodies of people.

00:08:01.850 --> 00:08:05.710
By the time they found it, 
there had already been many victims.

00:08:07.070 --> 00:08:09.560
They managed to exterminate it with fire,

00:08:09.560 --> 00:08:14.120
but one of the victims was a very young child.

00:08:16.220 --> 00:08:20.620
The look on my father's face that day isn't something I'll forget soon.

00:08:20.620 --> 00:08:22.440
I see.

00:08:22.440 --> 00:08:25.620
But this gives you the proof you need, right?

00:08:26.040 --> 00:08:30.880
Not quite. Some of the guests today are nobles of the court.

00:08:31.410 --> 00:08:35.630
They're just as guilty, but there's not enough here to prove it.

00:08:36.090 --> 00:08:39.640
Let's pretend to be guests for a bit longer
and wait for a good opportunity.

00:08:42.390 --> 00:08:43.890
What are <i>you</i> smirking at?

00:08:43.890 --> 00:08:45.220
Nothing.

00:08:45.890 --> 00:08:47.800
Can never tell what you're thinking, kid.

00:08:48.640 --> 00:08:50.210
Let's move.

00:08:50.210 --> 00:08:51.150
Gotcha.

00:08:51.150 --> 00:08:53.670
Wait, give me back my sake!

00:08:53.670 --> 00:08:55.430
Oh, right.

00:09:00.710 --> 00:09:01.910
There isn't a single drop left!

00:09:02.790 --> 00:09:06.240
It'd be faster if we could 
just search his rooms...

00:09:06.240 --> 00:09:08.170
Give me back my sake!

00:09:12.170 --> 00:09:13.790
Red!

00:09:13.790 --> 00:09:15.670
Red! Red!

00:09:15.670 --> 00:09:17.930
Black! Black, Black, Black!

00:09:17.930 --> 00:09:19.680
It'll be Black for sure this time!

00:09:27.540 --> 00:09:30.060
I'm on a winnin' streak!

00:09:31.030 --> 00:09:33.570
Three losses in a row?

00:09:34.690 --> 00:09:35.480
Hey.

00:09:35.480 --> 00:09:37.890
Oh, heya mister!

00:09:37.890 --> 00:09:39.590
Enjoyin' yourself?

00:09:39.590 --> 00:09:40.710
No.

00:09:40.710 --> 00:09:43.080
Stop messing around and help us already.

00:09:43.080 --> 00:09:45.560
I've been doin' my bit.

00:09:45.560 --> 00:09:48.430
While placin' my bets,

00:09:49.070 --> 00:09:52.090
I've been keepin' a real good eye out for anyone suspicious-looking!

00:09:52.090 --> 00:09:53.590
Really now?

00:09:54.370 --> 00:09:58.090
By the way, where's your partner?

00:09:59.250 --> 00:10:01.090
He said he was going to ask some questions.

00:10:01.090 --> 00:10:04.600
He really blends into a crowd fast.

00:10:08.050 --> 00:10:09.050
Bad news!

00:10:09.050 --> 00:10:11.190
The bugs... The bugs are—

00:10:38.870 --> 00:10:39.630
Get outta here!

00:10:43.690 --> 00:10:45.640
This place is done for.

00:10:46.280 --> 00:10:48.780
What the hell is the owner doing?

00:10:50.420 --> 00:10:52.400
My deepest apologies!

00:10:53.120 --> 00:10:57.150
It seems the bugs destroyed their cages!

00:10:57.670 --> 00:11:01.280
The ship is now swarming with bugs!

00:11:01.750 --> 00:11:02.910
I forgive you.

00:11:04.910 --> 00:11:07.090
Don't make the same mistake again.

00:11:08.060 --> 00:11:09.440
Magnificent, Dekoponpo-sama!

00:11:09.440 --> 00:11:10.910
Your kindness truly knows no bounds!

00:11:10.910 --> 00:11:13.060
I'll leave you in charge.

00:11:13.060 --> 00:11:16.050
Do not lose even a single speck of gold dust.

00:11:16.050 --> 00:11:17.420
Of course.

00:11:18.130 --> 00:11:23.010
I, Bokoinante, shall personally carry out all of your treasures.

00:11:23.010 --> 00:11:26.430
I leave it in your hands, Bokoinante.

00:11:26.430 --> 00:11:27.750
Yes, sir!

00:11:42.610 --> 00:11:44.110
Dekoponpo-sama!

00:11:45.740 --> 00:11:47.030
There's just no end to them.

00:11:47.030 --> 00:11:49.190
Hey, we need to get out of here!

00:11:49.190 --> 00:11:50.790
I'd love to, but...

00:11:52.430 --> 00:11:54.880
Scum or not, they're still citizens of Yamato.

00:11:55.460 --> 00:11:57.350
I cannot neglect them!

00:11:57.350 --> 00:11:59.880
Jeez... You're a real pain, you know that?

00:12:03.810 --> 00:12:04.640
What's wrong?

00:12:05.190 --> 00:12:08.390
I don't really like creepy-crawlies...

00:12:10.220 --> 00:12:12.060
Nasty!

00:12:17.790 --> 00:12:19.900
I'm all covered in it!

00:12:22.900 --> 00:12:25.000
Why am I stuck with these people?

00:12:25.510 --> 00:12:29.910
Hey, do you think Dekoponpo's room 
is unguarded right now?

00:12:29.910 --> 00:12:32.260
Yeah, probably.

00:12:32.260 --> 00:12:33.910
Good! Go for it!

00:12:33.910 --> 00:12:36.540
Wait, you mean me?

00:12:36.910 --> 00:12:38.920
His room's at the very top.

00:12:39.410 --> 00:12:40.590
Don't screw it up!

00:12:40.590 --> 00:12:43.170
Hey, don't just decide stuff like that!

00:12:46.200 --> 00:12:47.470
Sheesh...

00:12:47.470 --> 00:12:48.800
Fine!

00:12:54.570 --> 00:12:57.310
Goodness, what a disaster that was.

00:12:57.760 --> 00:13:02.470
But I'm relieved to see your life and treasures are safe!

00:13:03.320 --> 00:13:06.320
S-Save me!

00:13:08.320 --> 00:13:14.820
How dare you touch Dekoponpo-sama's 
boat with your filthy hands!?

00:13:14.820 --> 00:13:16.830
Wouldn't you agree, Dekoponpo-sama?

00:13:17.370 --> 00:13:19.080
I can't find it.

00:13:19.080 --> 00:13:21.390
By "it" you mean...

00:13:23.000 --> 00:13:25.090
The Golden Goddess!?

00:13:28.520 --> 00:13:31.440
Perhaps it is still aboard the ship?

00:13:32.440 --> 00:13:35.730
I leave it to you, Bokoinante.

00:13:35.730 --> 00:13:37.710
I shall deal with this at once!

00:13:46.970 --> 00:13:49.070
Anybody home?

00:13:49.070 --> 00:13:51.370
Didn't think so.

00:13:52.360 --> 00:13:55.640
Now, let's see what I can find...

00:13:58.290 --> 00:13:59.910
Not much here...

00:13:59.910 --> 00:14:01.880
Oh, what's this?

00:14:04.880 --> 00:14:08.220
This is sure to make good evidence!

00:14:08.220 --> 00:14:10.360
What are you doing, scoundrel!?

00:14:11.370 --> 00:14:12.850
Stealing amidst a crisis?

00:14:12.850 --> 00:14:14.390
Stay right there!

00:14:27.130 --> 00:14:29.910
I guess I'll have to glue it back together.

00:14:29.910 --> 00:14:34.410
Wretched villain, how dare you ruin Dekoponpo-sama's treasure!?

00:14:39.660 --> 00:14:43.590
Evidence of corruption by Dekoponpo, 
one of the Eight Pillar Generals,

00:14:43.590 --> 00:14:44.890
is in our hands now!

00:14:46.100 --> 00:14:47.420
Who are you?

00:14:48.100 --> 00:14:50.430
Villains are undeserving of our names!

00:14:50.420 --> 00:14:52.430
Farewell.

00:14:54.190 --> 00:14:55.180
Hold it!

00:14:58.180 --> 00:15:00.600
Curse you!

00:15:01.590 --> 00:15:03.440
Well, see you around...

00:15:05.280 --> 00:15:06.720
Halt, scoundrel!

00:15:06.720 --> 00:15:08.190
Don't worry about me!

00:15:09.690 --> 00:15:12.860
Nasty!

00:15:24.500 --> 00:15:25.250
Move it!

00:15:58.730 --> 00:16:00.300
<i>Throw that thing away!</i>

00:16:00.790 --> 00:16:03.790
<i>At least let me keep one half!</i>

00:16:04.290 --> 00:16:06.440
<i>Give it up already!</i>

00:16:21.310 --> 00:16:25.040
What, they're not going to help us?

00:16:25.040 --> 00:16:27.310
You called the others, too?

00:16:27.830 --> 00:16:30.700
I didn't know what was going to happen.

00:16:31.350 --> 00:16:34.710
Well, I just made sure we had a backup plan.

00:16:35.740 --> 00:16:39.360
We never did end up finding that evidence, huh?

00:16:39.360 --> 00:16:41.530
Well, I'm sure things'll work out.

00:16:44.080 --> 00:16:47.040
Those bugs are still alive?

00:16:47.040 --> 00:16:48.760
This is bad, Ukon!

00:16:49.320 --> 00:16:50.600
Don't panic.

00:16:51.740 --> 00:16:52.840
You didn't think...

00:16:53.730 --> 00:16:55.840
you were the only one with a backup plan, did you?

00:16:57.840 --> 00:16:59.360
Hey, who's that?

00:17:01.330 --> 00:17:03.660
The Royal General of the Left, Mikazuchi.

00:17:05.350 --> 00:17:07.430
One of the Twin Walls 
of the Imperial Capital,

00:17:07.430 --> 00:17:10.360
who feels the same duty towards the people as Oshutoru.

00:17:18.760 --> 00:17:22.520
Hey, how does it feel to have no memories?

00:17:23.420 --> 00:17:24.870
What brought this on?

00:17:25.390 --> 00:17:27.870
Do you ever wish you could get them back?

00:17:28.340 --> 00:17:29.670
Well...

00:17:29.670 --> 00:17:31.880
It's never really bothered me.

00:17:31.880 --> 00:17:33.630
That's how it works, huh?

00:17:33.630 --> 00:17:35.150
That's how it works.

00:17:35.150 --> 00:17:37.160
For now, I can make a living.

00:17:37.740 --> 00:17:39.190
And since I don't have a past,

00:17:39.190 --> 00:17:42.390
I don't need to have two identities like you.

00:17:42.390 --> 00:17:43.960
I see.

00:17:43.960 --> 00:17:45.430
You're a lucky guy, you know.

00:17:46.320 --> 00:17:48.390
I was born to a country noble.

00:17:49.500 --> 00:17:52.810
I always wanted to be like my dad,
sharing life's joys and sorrows

00:17:53.330 --> 00:17:54.940
with all of his people.

00:17:56.500 --> 00:18:00.490
I did everything I could to follow in his footsteps.

00:18:01.430 --> 00:18:04.950
I went to serve in the capital, like he did,

00:18:05.640 --> 00:18:07.610
and worked as hard as I possibly could.

00:18:09.350 --> 00:18:12.860
And then, one fortuitous event after another,

00:18:13.360 --> 00:18:16.550
I found myself honored with the 
rank of General of the Right.

00:18:17.470 --> 00:18:20.470
Your dad must be pretty happy, then.

00:18:21.090 --> 00:18:24.120
But as I climbed the ranks, 
I began to realize

00:18:24.120 --> 00:18:25.770
that my hands were tied.

00:18:26.250 --> 00:18:29.760
{I couldn't hear the voices of the little people.}I couldn't hear the voices of the people.

00:18:30.450 --> 00:18:32.480
And that's where "Ukon" comes in?

00:18:33.460 --> 00:18:37.990
"Ukon" was the person I always wanted to be.

00:18:37.990 --> 00:18:41.990
It was Oshutoru who saved us today, though.

00:18:42.990 --> 00:18:48.000
Only another Royal General could've 
made sure Mikazuchi took action.

00:18:48.730 --> 00:18:49.550
Am I wrong?

00:18:50.600 --> 00:18:52.910
No, you're absolutely right.

00:18:53.830 --> 00:18:56.130
Looks like things have calmed down.

00:18:56.130 --> 00:18:57.260
Wanna go get a drink?

00:18:57.260 --> 00:18:58.300
You know it.

00:18:58.300 --> 00:19:00.060
And you're paying.

00:20:59.750 --> 00:21:00.920
We offer an invitation.

00:21:01.520 --> 00:21:03.590
Please come with us.

00:21:06.050 --> 00:21:07.110
Who are you?

00:21:24.920 --> 00:21:28.030
Hey, where are you taking me?

00:21:28.450 --> 00:21:29.430
It is close.

00:21:29.960 --> 00:21:32.270
We will be at our destination shortly.

00:21:43.740 --> 00:21:44.630
Where am I?

00:21:48.280 --> 00:21:50.110
Welcome.

00:21:50.110 --> 00:21:51.680
Please, have a seat.

00:22:01.290 --> 00:22:02.380
Who are you?

00:22:02.910 --> 00:22:04.520
Well, now...

00:22:04.520 --> 00:22:06.320
My name is Mito.

00:22:11.630 --> 00:22:12.490
Here you are.

00:22:13.380 --> 00:22:14.390
Thanks.

00:22:18.290 --> 00:22:20.080
Is something the matter?

00:22:20.080 --> 00:22:21.200
No...

00:22:22.260 --> 00:22:24.090
Have we met somewhere?

00:22:24.090 --> 00:22:25.020
No.

00:22:25.840 --> 00:22:27.740
Yeah, I guess not.

00:22:32.360 --> 00:22:33.400
This is good.

00:22:33.400 --> 00:22:34.350
And...

00:22:35.040 --> 00:22:36.680
Is this green tea?

00:22:36.680 --> 00:22:38.750
Why does it taste so familiar?

00:22:40.600 --> 00:22:43.110
I'm told you have no recollection of your past.

00:22:43.110 --> 00:22:44.210
Yeah.

00:22:44.210 --> 00:22:47.090
Apparently, I woke up in the 
middle of the mountains.

00:22:47.570 --> 00:22:50.110
I guess that doesn't tell you much.

00:22:50.110 --> 00:22:51.790
As you can see,

00:22:51.790 --> 00:22:55.990
I'm far too old to venture outside.

00:22:55.990 --> 00:22:59.870
Hearing stories told by others is my greatest pleasure.

00:23:00.300 --> 00:23:04.950
Would you perhaps let me hear your story?

00:23:05.430 --> 00:23:09.500
Of how this world appeared to you, 
and how you felt about it,

00:23:09.500 --> 00:23:11.640
after you woke up with no memories?

00:23:11.640 --> 00:23:12.660
Okay...

00:23:12.660 --> 00:23:15.890
Can I have some more tea, then?

00:23:18.350 --> 00:23:19.140
Honoka.

00:23:19.620 --> 00:23:20.220
But of course.

00:23:24.150 --> 00:23:26.090
Well, where to begin...

00:23:26.510 --> 00:23:27.400
